---
description: Supabase RLS and key rules for SQL and data routes
globs:
  - supabase/**
  - src/lib/supabase/**
  - src/app/**/route.ts
  - src/app/contact-action.ts
  - src/app/admin/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Enable RLS on every table. Admin reads and writes use `public.is_blog_admin()`. `anon` may insert only where that is the product (`contact_messages`). It must not select private rows.

The browser may use `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` only. Never put a service-role key in client code or in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.

Do not apply migrations from the app. Dave runs SQL in the Supabase editor. Leave the Supabase project name and env vars as they are.
